    0.4.4-dev - 2026/05/10 (713835c) [develop]
        :brief 默认 PaperRun 引擎自动记录完整 observability audit 覆盖
        :changes
        - fix(observability): 新增 recordDefaultPaperRunObservability, 自动记录 model_role/capability/subagent/tool/data_egress/cost
        - fix(run): createPaperRun 在默认 stage graph 之后写入 observability baseline, 不再依赖测试或调用方手动补 audit
        - fix(strict): strict acceptance 的 Git Flow 检查允许 `fix/*` 活动分支, 与当前分支策略一致
        - fix(strict): Write-Report 对 Windows 短暂文件占用增加重试, 避免阶段性报告写入偶发失败
        - test(observability): 新增默认 PaperRun coverage 回归, 要求 missing_kinds 为空
        - test(strict): 覆盖 active task work 可在 feature/fix 分支上运行 strict acceptance, 并检查报告写入重试
        - docs(report): 新增 reports/default-observability-coverage.md 记录 live benchmark coverage
        :src
            - packages/opencode/src/paper/observability.ts - default run observability recorder
            - packages/opencode/src/paper/run.ts - default engine audit integration
            - packages/opencode/test/paper/observability-audit.test.ts - default coverage regression
            - scripts/strict-acceptance.ps1 - Git Flow active branch validation
