    0.4.2-dev - 2026/05/10 (18562fb) [develop]
        :brief 对齐 PaperRun 完成态、真实性 gate 与 reproduction_failure 阶段展示
        :changes
        - fix(paperrun): PaperRun snapshot status 新增 blocked, 完整执行但 final gate 阻断时不再显示 running
        - fix(controller): durable controller 新增 review_required, 用于已跑完但需要证据/复现/审查的 run
        - fix(stage): final gate 的 reproduction_failure 反投影到 reproduction stage, 避免复现阶段成功但最终 gate 因复现失败阻断的矛盾
        - fix(runtime): 完整执行完成后内部 ResearchRun 可标记 succeeded, PaperRun eligibility 仍由 gate 投影为 blocked
        - test(paperrun): 增加 completed-but-blocked run 终态回归断言
        - docs(report): 新增 reports/paperrun-completion-gates.md 记录状态语义与验证
        :src
            - packages/opencode/src/paper/run.ts - PaperRun terminal status and reproduction gate projection
            - packages/opencode/src/paper/run-controller.ts - review_required controller status
            - packages/opencode/src/cli/cmd/tui/routes/paper/workbench.ts - Chinese controller label and fallback status projection
            - packages/opencode/test/paper/paperrun-execution.test.ts - completed blocked run regression
            - reports/paperrun-completion-gates.md - gate alignment report
            - .plan/confirmed/task-048-paperrun-completion-gates.yaml - TaskFlow execution logs
